WEBVTT

02:13.590 --> 02:14.310
Boss!

02:14.630 --> 02:15.430
One bowl of tofu pudding, please.

02:16.840 --> 02:18.710
Fenghua, why are you back?

02:18.750 --> 02:19.240
Auntie.

02:19.430 --> 02:19.840
Auntie.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.360
We'd like a bowl too.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.000
Wanghe, Xingchi, Haikuo!

02:22.910 --> 02:23.870
How did you all get back?

02:24.030 --> 02:24.430
By car.

02:24.910 --> 02:25.960
It must have been a tiring journey.

02:26.150 --> 02:26.750
Hurry, hurry.

02:27.000 --> 02:27.520
Go home first.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.680
Let your family know you're back.

02:28.870 --> 02:30.430
Come back to my shop for tofu pudding later.

02:31.000 --> 02:31.470
Are we closing?

02:31.470 --> 02:32.400
At least for now.

02:33.120 --> 02:34.150
This is great!

02:35.800 --> 02:37.190
Are you back for the Mid-Autumn Festival?

02:37.750 --> 02:38.520
I missed you.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.150
This is wonderful!

02:44.840 --> 02:45.430
Eat up quickly.

02:46.079 --> 02:46.470
This...

02:46.910 --> 02:47.680
Look at you.

02:48.030 --> 02:49.240
Coming all this way just to visit.

02:49.360 --> 02:50.430
You're really something.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.710
It's the Mid-Autumn Festival.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.430
I wanted to come back for a family reunion dinner.

02:53.840 --> 02:54.430
You're busy,

02:54.520 --> 02:55.470
and we can video chat now.

02:55.800 --> 02:56.960
It's the same wherever you are.

02:57.030 --> 02:57.680
Exactly.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.400
How about I go back to Beijing now?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.120
Don't you dare.

03:02.080 --> 03:02.400
Here.

03:02.400 --> 03:02.710
Have some buns.

03:02.840 --> 03:03.150
Come.

03:03.280 --> 03:03.630
Okay.

03:03.630 --> 03:04.400
It's hot.

03:07.150 --> 03:08.800
How long are you staying this time?

03:09.030 --> 03:10.240
I have to leave tomorrow.

03:10.630 --> 03:11.360
Leaving tomorrow?

03:12.190 --> 03:14.280
What’s the point of making this trip back here?

03:15.280 --> 03:16.150
Work's been hectic.

03:16.360 --> 03:18.030
This time, it was Wanghe who helped arrange time off too.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.240
Otherwise, I couldn't have come.

03:19.870 --> 03:20.590
It's good to be busy.

03:21.190 --> 03:21.910
Being busy...

03:22.800 --> 03:24.520
means the company values you more.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.150
They're willing to give you more responsibilities.

03:27.150 --> 03:29.280
Grandpa, Wanghe is now my boss.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.520
Xingchi and I work under him.

03:32.430 --> 03:34.079
Right, this boss of yours...

03:34.750 --> 03:36.000
How is he treating you?

03:36.520 --> 03:37.120
Pretty good.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.590
He’s been a big help to the two of us at work.

03:40.079 --> 03:41.400
We can learn a lot from him.

03:43.150 --> 03:44.030
What about his personal life?

03:44.400 --> 03:46.120
Their personal lives aren’t as good as mine.

03:46.870 --> 03:47.870
They're both single.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.710
They need to learn from me in this aspect.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.630
These days, your grandson also has

03:51.750 --> 03:53.400
someone to come home to after work.

03:57.150 --> 03:58.800
Dad, did you hear that?

03:58.960 --> 03:59.630
Your grandson

04:00.080 --> 04:02.470
is shamelessly bragging and showing off.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.960
It's better to be like you.

04:05.590 --> 04:07.000
As a single, you're free.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.710
Cut it out.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.120
Alright, I'm done talking.

04:10.280 --> 04:11.080
I'll go prepare some food for you.

04:11.470 --> 04:12.910
Ask them if there's anything they want to eat.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.680
Okay, thanks, Dad.

04:16.480 --> 04:17.560
Don't be like your dad.

04:19.870 --> 04:20.600
Oh yes, Grandpa.

04:22.070 --> 04:23.600
My girlfriend bought you some mooncakes.

04:23.600 --> 04:24.120
Really?

04:24.270 --> 04:25.190
They're from Daoxiangcun.

04:25.680 --> 04:26.560
That's nice.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.630
I'm off to work.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.560
Our son just got back.

04:30.560 --> 04:32.360
Why can't you have a chat with him and go later?

04:32.720 --> 04:34.120
It's not like he doesn't have a phone.

04:34.159 --> 04:35.630
Can't we chat on the phone?

04:35.630 --> 04:36.390
It's fine, just go ahead.

04:38.310 --> 04:38.920
I'm off then.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.950
Come home early after work.

04:39.950 --> 04:41.000
Where else could I go?

04:46.310 --> 04:47.510
Do you two still argue these days?

04:49.070 --> 04:50.120
What arguments?

04:50.120 --> 04:51.120
We're too old for that now.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.270
Just thinking about it is exhausting.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.159
Don't worry, everything's fine.

04:55.600 --> 04:57.360
Don't just share the good news and leave out the bad.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.920
You're the one who only shares good news.

04:59.600 --> 05:01.830
With all that you've experienced in Beijing,

05:02.720 --> 05:04.040
you nearly gave me a heart attack.

05:04.040 --> 05:04.750
You know that?

05:04.950 --> 05:05.560
Mom.

05:07.480 --> 05:09.000
Your son is on the right path now.

05:10.070 --> 05:10.680
Let me tell you.

05:10.870 --> 05:11.680
In just two years,

05:11.870 --> 05:13.120
all the things I bragged about before

05:13.480 --> 05:14.070
will be fulfilled.

05:16.070 --> 05:17.950
There's never enough money to be made.

05:18.190 --> 05:19.160
As long as you stay on the right path,

05:19.160 --> 05:20.600
your mom will be at peace.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.480
I know.

05:24.950 --> 05:25.800
Have an egg.

05:28.000 --> 05:28.830
Granny Ma.

05:29.360 --> 05:31.040
Fenghua has come back from Beijing.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.110
She's here to see you.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.480
How quickly time flies.

06:00.270 --> 06:01.390
In the blink of an eye,

06:02.510 --> 06:04.870
it's been 7 years since Granny Ma passed away.

06:06.630 --> 06:07.600
The same goes for Siyi.

06:09.830 --> 06:11.480
She still hasn't contacted you?

06:16.230 --> 06:17.750
That ungrateful girl.

06:20.070 --> 06:21.630
I wonder if she’s doing well

06:23.270 --> 06:24.830
on her own out there.

06:26.190 --> 06:27.830
You'd think at least during the holidays,

06:28.390 --> 06:29.560
she'd send a greeting.

06:30.360 --> 06:31.680
All that worry for nothing.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.830
She must have her reasons.

06:34.270 --> 06:35.480
If she has her reasons, she should say so.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.360
You were such close friends,

06:37.830 --> 06:39.270
yet she left without a word.

06:40.870 --> 06:41.950
Even the closest relationships

06:42.870 --> 06:44.390
can't withstand such torment.

06:48.720 --> 06:49.680
I believe that

06:50.800 --> 06:51.560
one day,

06:52.510 --> 06:53.950
when she's worn out from wandering around,

06:54.870 --> 06:55.600
she'll come back.

06:59.390 --> 07:01.120
Who knows if we'll still be around by then.

07:02.430 --> 07:03.510
By the time she returns,

07:06.190 --> 07:07.120
this courtyard might...

07:09.270 --> 07:10.160
already be emptied.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.950
Fenghua, Auntie.

07:22.830 --> 07:24.240
My dad's treating everyone to lunch, so please come.

07:24.950 --> 07:25.480
Alright.

07:26.870 --> 07:28.800
I want to eat soft-braised eel,

07:28.800 --> 07:29.720
braised shredded tofu...

07:39.190 --> 07:40.000
Granny Ma,

07:42.600 --> 07:43.560
it's Mid-Autumn Festival.

07:44.560 --> 07:45.310
We're all together now.

08:37.669 --> 08:38.840
Squirrel-shaped mandarin fish.

08:39.510 --> 08:40.320
Here it comes!

08:40.840 --> 08:42.080
Squirrel-shaped mandarin fish.

08:44.480 --> 08:45.440
Grandpa, don't drink too much.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.510
Okay, I don't need you to tell me.

08:47.080 --> 08:48.550
By the way, come back often.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.320
Come back and visit us often.

08:49.360 --> 08:50.120
Come back often.

08:50.360 --> 08:50.670
Come back often.

08:50.670 --> 08:51.150
But...

08:51.510 --> 08:53.440
He has a lot of business in Beijing.

08:56.720 --> 08:57.550
Welcome, Mayor.

08:57.550 --> 08:59.200
Happy holidays.

08:59.480 --> 09:00.510
Cheers!

09:03.840 --> 09:04.360
Today...

09:04.870 --> 09:06.080
There's more good news.

09:06.510 --> 09:09.240
The comprehensive upgrading and renovation of our Flower Street

09:09.270 --> 09:11.080
has already begun.

09:11.120 --> 09:12.960
Upgrade? To what?

09:13.360 --> 09:14.150
It's exactly this courtyard

09:14.150 --> 09:15.480
where we are all living now.

09:16.000 --> 09:17.440
Houses that have fallen into disrepair will,

09:17.750 --> 09:20.790
in principle, be renovated on-site.

09:22.320 --> 09:23.000
On-site?

09:23.030 --> 09:23.720
Then, then...

09:23.910 --> 09:25.440
Do we need to move out?

09:25.840 --> 09:26.750
Currently, the plan

09:26.750 --> 09:27.870
has been submitted.

09:27.870 --> 09:28.960
Let's try to make plans

09:29.270 --> 09:31.080
and minimise disruption to your daily lives.

09:31.480 --> 09:32.000
That's great!

09:32.000 --> 09:33.840
When will it start?

09:34.360 --> 09:35.870
If everything goes as planned,

09:35.870 --> 09:36.600
next month.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.120
That's so soon!

09:38.120 --> 09:39.600
That is really quick and productive!

09:39.600 --> 09:40.150
Indeed!

09:40.150 --> 09:41.630
This is great news that deserves celebration.

09:41.630 --> 09:42.320
Renovation...

09:42.840 --> 09:43.840
What will it be like after the renovation?

09:43.840 --> 09:45.270
I don't know, they're still planning.

09:45.910 --> 09:47.120
But they'll most likely

09:47.120 --> 09:49.200
try to preserve the original appearance of the old buildings as much as possible.

09:49.840 --> 09:51.910
Does our courtyard count as an old building?

09:52.750 --> 09:53.510
It should be.

09:54.200 --> 09:54.720
My grandpa said

09:54.720 --> 09:56.390
the main hall is over 200 years old.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.550
As for Granny Ma's residence,

09:58.000 --> 10:00.200
county records say it once produced a successful imperial examination candidate.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.750
What about my house?

10:01.750 --> 10:02.600
It produced servants.

10:03.630 --> 10:04.320
No, for real though.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.840
Granny Ma lives in the main hall,

10:06.840 --> 10:07.790
so that's the master's room.

10:08.670 --> 10:10.790
Your house and mine are the peripheral rooms,

10:11.320 --> 10:12.840
where the maids and servants lived.

10:15.200 --> 10:17.240
No wonder my grades were poor when I was young.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.910
So it’s an issue of feng shui.

10:19.550 --> 10:21.200
If I had lived in the same room as Siyi back then,

10:21.390 --> 10:23.030
I might have gotten into a 985 university.

10:23.030 --> 10:25.600
I think even if Siyi had been admitted, she might not have gone.

10:26.510 --> 10:27.870
I remember she told me before the college entrance exam

10:28.360 --> 10:30.790
that she thinks experience from traveling is more valuable than reading countless books.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.000
And over these years,

10:32.000 --> 10:34.510
she's been proving this saying with her actions.

10:35.150 --> 10:36.320
You knew Siyi would leave?

10:37.360 --> 10:38.550
I guessed that it was a possibility.

10:38.790 --> 10:40.440
Why didn't you tell us back then?

10:40.670 --> 10:41.960
With Siyi's personality,

10:42.030 --> 10:43.150
what good would it have done to say anything?

10:43.150 --> 10:44.200
Could we have kept her from leaving?

10:45.440 --> 10:47.840
I used to worry a lot about Siyi too.

10:47.840 --> 10:49.320
I was worried she'd suffer out there alone,

10:49.510 --> 10:50.480
or be mistreated.

10:50.720 --> 10:52.200
But I don't think so anymore.

10:52.790 --> 10:53.440
Just recently,

10:53.630 --> 10:55.510
together with Grandpa Zhou, Uncle Shao, and my dad,

10:55.510 --> 10:56.240
we went on a business trip.

10:56.550 --> 10:58.600
It was to trace the Shao family's ancestral footsteps.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.840
It wasn't really that far,

11:00.840 --> 11:01.600
but along the way,

11:01.600 --> 11:03.480
I felt so happy

11:03.480 --> 11:04.320
and excited.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.440
I felt that it was the first time I truly

11:06.440 --> 11:08.150
experienced the joy of traveling.

11:08.550 --> 11:10.240
I believe it's the same for Siyi.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.720
As long as you have hope

11:11.720 --> 11:12.320
and a goal,

11:12.510 --> 11:13.390
when you are on the road,

11:13.390 --> 11:15.200
no matter how tired or difficult it gets for you,

11:15.240 --> 11:16.070
you'll feel that

11:16.270 --> 11:17.240
your heart is beating,

11:17.240 --> 11:18.790
and life has its purpose.

11:26.360 --> 11:26.910
Come on.

11:27.630 --> 11:28.320
A toast

11:28.960 --> 11:30.000
to Siyi, who's far away.

11:31.440 --> 11:31.790
To Siyi.

11:31.790 --> 11:32.790
To Siyi.

11:39.200 --> 11:40.630
I'm fine.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.390
Sit down, sit down.

11:41.630 --> 11:42.440
Is that okay?

11:42.720 --> 11:43.510
Okay.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.000
Alright.

11:51.440 --> 11:54.720
Happy Mid-Autumn Festival!

11:57.480 --> 11:57.960
Fenghua.

11:58.320 --> 11:58.670
Here,

11:58.870 --> 11:59.440
have a tangerine.

11:59.550 --> 12:00.670
The new ones are really sweet.

12:01.320 --> 12:01.910
Thanks, Mom.

12:06.030 --> 12:07.080
Stop watching.

12:09.030 --> 12:10.120
Chat with me for a bit.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.910
Every time we talk on the phone, you're always in such a rush.

12:12.910 --> 12:14.360
You hang up before we're even done talking.

12:14.550 --> 12:15.200
Well, go ahead.

12:16.510 --> 12:17.440
Be honest with me.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.790
Do you have a boyfriend?

12:21.550 --> 12:22.440
What do you mean 'ah'?

12:22.750 --> 12:23.480
I'm your mother.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.720
Your eyes can't fool me.

12:27.200 --> 12:28.550
What's wrong with my eyes?

12:28.550 --> 12:29.440
They are pretty normal.

12:29.960 --> 12:30.550
Come on, tell me.

12:31.910 --> 12:33.120
There's no one, really.

12:33.750 --> 12:36.150
I'm so busy I barely have time to eat,

12:36.240 --> 12:37.630
let alone find a boyfriend.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.390
So you plan to stay single forever?

12:40.120 --> 12:41.870
Well, I can't force it if there's no one.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.600
I'm not the type to simply settle.

12:43.600 --> 12:45.030
Well, your dad and I just settled for each other.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.790
Aren't we doing fine now?

12:48.120 --> 12:48.750
Fine.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.910
I'll just find someone randomly then.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.720
Don't be picky when the time comes,

12:52.720 --> 12:53.670
complaining about this and that.

12:53.670 --> 12:54.630
That won't do.

12:54.870 --> 12:56.200
Character comes first.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.390
I don't care about anything else.

12:59.320 --> 12:59.960
Well, rest assured,

13:00.120 --> 13:01.080
he has pretty good character.

13:02.750 --> 13:03.750
Looks like you’re busted!

13:04.510 --> 13:05.600
So, do you have a boyfriend?

13:06.200 --> 13:07.630
Do you have a boyfriend?

13:07.630 --> 13:08.630
You tricked me!

13:08.910 --> 13:11.030
Come clean with me. What does he do?

13:11.030 --> 13:11.910
How old is he?

13:11.910 --> 13:12.480
Do you have any photos?

13:12.670 --> 13:13.000
Hurry.

13:13.080 --> 13:13.670
Do you have any photos?

13:13.670 --> 13:14.480
Let me see!

13:16.000 --> 13:17.080
Mom! Mom!

13:20.390 --> 13:22.870
I haven't decided if I want to be with him yet.

13:23.000 --> 13:24.150
Don't pressure me.

13:24.150 --> 13:25.670
Why haven't you decided?

13:27.630 --> 13:28.480
It's complicated.

13:30.030 --> 13:31.240
I'm really looking forward to it,

13:32.550 --> 13:33.390
but I also feel scared.

13:36.960 --> 13:38.120
Give me some time.

13:39.000 --> 13:39.910
When I've figured it out,

13:40.030 --> 13:41.720
I'll tell you right away.

13:41.720 --> 13:42.320
I promise.

13:43.200 --> 13:44.200
What else are you waiting for?

13:44.630 --> 13:45.790
Worrying about this and that.

13:46.120 --> 13:46.840
By the time you figure it out,

13:46.840 --> 13:47.750
it'll be too late.

13:48.840 --> 13:49.870
It won't be.

13:49.870 --> 13:50.840
Why not?

13:51.390 --> 13:52.670
What era are we living in?

13:52.670 --> 13:53.790
Who's going to wait for you?

13:54.440 --> 13:55.630
If you have feelings, just go for it.

13:55.630 --> 13:56.840
You have to capture the opportunity.

13:57.270 --> 13:59.030
If you don't, they'll turn around and find someone else.

13:59.390 --> 14:00.550
How does that song lyric go?

14:02.030 --> 14:04.390
"I've been waiting for you until my heart aches,

14:05.080 --> 14:07.550
been waiting for you until I'm gone."

14:08.200 --> 14:09.630
They'll be long gone.

14:09.630 --> 14:11.200
You silly child.

14:12.270 --> 14:12.910
Seriously.

14:13.630 --> 14:14.440
Wait and wait.

14:18.270 --> 14:20.120
Here, Son. This one has roe in it.

14:20.240 --> 14:20.840
Eat more.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.120
Just come back when you crave for it.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.200
Eat more.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.240
Tell me.

14:26.240 --> 14:28.000
How much money have you saved?

14:28.630 --> 14:29.870
You mean savings?

14:30.150 --> 14:30.870
Any kind of money.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.030
We just want to know how much money you have.

14:33.030 --> 14:34.240
This way, we'll know how much money we need to give you

14:34.240 --> 14:35.550
when you get married.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.080
Right?

14:36.200 --> 14:37.480
Why should you give me money?

14:37.910 --> 14:39.870
How can I ask you guys for money when it's my wedding?

14:40.510 --> 14:41.510
Say no more.

14:41.870 --> 14:43.630
Just tell us the truth.

14:44.000 --> 14:45.150
How much money

14:45.320 --> 14:46.480
do you really have?

14:48.030 --> 14:49.320
I don't have much cash.

14:49.910 --> 14:50.870
About 70,000 to 80,000 yuan.

14:52.120 --> 14:53.440
I used the rest of my money to buy stocks.

14:54.030 --> 14:54.750
Which stock did you buy?

14:55.390 --> 14:56.000
Moutai.

14:56.790 --> 14:57.550
And I have a car.

14:57.870 --> 14:58.600
It's gifted by my boss.

15:00.150 --> 15:01.320
That's not much.

15:02.600 --> 15:02.910
Wait.

15:03.120 --> 15:03.600
So...

15:03.600 --> 15:04.960
all these years you've been out there,

15:05.630 --> 15:06.790
what have you been up to?

15:06.790 --> 15:08.440
Look at you.

15:08.790 --> 15:09.320
Pretending

15:09.550 --> 15:10.840
to be a successful person around us?

15:13.000 --> 15:14.600
I have options in Bee.

15:15.240 --> 15:16.150
Quite a lot of them, actually.

15:16.840 --> 15:18.120
Once the company gets listed,

15:18.630 --> 15:19.790
I'll have complete financial independence.

15:20.790 --> 15:21.390
What if it doesn't get listed?

15:22.030 --> 15:22.960
We could do a merger and acquisition.

15:23.390 --> 15:25.030
As long as this company doesn't go bankrupt,

15:26.000 --> 15:26.870
I won't be poor.

15:28.510 --> 15:30.440
So you mean...

15:31.480 --> 15:32.870
you're really a successful businessman?

15:32.870 --> 15:34.480
How could I fake that, Mom?

15:36.030 --> 15:36.960
Look at our son.

15:37.600 --> 15:38.600
He's so smart.

15:38.600 --> 15:40.150
He's not the kind to be taken advantage of.

15:41.790 --> 15:44.030
Son, have you ever thought about

15:44.030 --> 15:44.910
coming back to develop your career here?

15:45.390 --> 15:45.910
Come back?

15:47.360 --> 15:48.150
What for?

15:49.000 --> 15:50.390
You see, Mayor Gu said

15:50.670 --> 15:51.120
that

15:51.120 --> 15:53.390
once our canal makes it onto the World Heritage List,

15:53.630 --> 15:56.360
the development potential for Flower Street will be huge.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.790
You're a successful entrepreneur now.

15:58.790 --> 15:59.790
A successful businessman.

16:00.080 --> 16:02.870
I don't consider it an accomplishment if you enjoy success alone.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.870
If you are really capable,

16:04.030 --> 16:06.630
come back and lead everyone to make a fortune.

16:06.630 --> 16:08.030
As the advertisement goes,

16:08.030 --> 16:10.030
"It's only beneficial when it delivers for everyone."

16:10.790 --> 16:11.440
Think about it.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.080
Think about it.

16:14.120 --> 16:16.070
It's because you two miss me, right?

16:17.840 --> 16:19.030
You can come to Beijing.

16:19.270 --> 16:20.150
Why should we go to Beijing?

16:21.200 --> 16:22.200
To live with me.

16:22.600 --> 16:23.200
Live?

16:23.750 --> 16:26.150
I'm not used to living in Beijing.

16:27.510 --> 16:28.390
I'm used to it.

16:30.120 --> 16:32.080
Come on.

16:32.080 --> 16:32.960
Come on, Mom.

16:34.200 --> 16:36.000
T-The wine is finished.

16:36.000 --> 16:36.840
All you know is drink.

16:36.840 --> 16:38.510
Go buy me another pot.

16:38.510 --> 16:40.840
I want one that has been aged 8 years.

16:40.840 --> 16:41.550
You've been drinking every day.

16:41.600 --> 16:43.390
I'll go.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.270
I'll go.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.600
Do you know which shop it is?

16:46.630 --> 16:48.320
Of course. How can I forget?

16:50.200 --> 16:50.840
Tell him

16:50.840 --> 16:52.510
it's me who's buying, and keep it on my tab.

16:55.910 --> 16:56.600
What do you think?

16:56.840 --> 16:58.080
I won't go to Beijing.

16:58.240 --> 16:59.510
I know you can't leave the canal.

16:59.790 --> 17:00.870
Did you notice

17:00.870 --> 17:02.510
there's something different about him this time?

17:02.840 --> 17:03.670
What's different?

17:27.160 --> 17:28.200
Aren't you afraid of falling down?

17:31.550 --> 17:33.480
It's okay. I can swim.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.110
You didn't go home for dinner?

17:37.830 --> 17:39.160
I did. What about you?

17:40.790 --> 17:41.830
I came out to buy wine for my dad.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.110
Are you feeling down?

17:47.000 --> 17:47.510
No.

17:47.920 --> 17:48.920
Then why are you sitting here?

17:49.920 --> 17:51.310
People might think

17:51.440 --> 17:53.200
you want to jump into the river.

17:56.590 --> 17:57.680
In Beijing,

17:58.880 --> 18:00.510
I always feel like I'm a passerby.

18:01.200 --> 18:02.920
I always feel restrained.

18:03.750 --> 18:04.680
But when I'm home,

18:06.240 --> 18:07.270
I feel empowered.

18:08.350 --> 18:10.480
I feel like I'm not afraid of anything.

18:11.000 --> 18:11.830
There's nothing I wouldn't say

18:12.550 --> 18:13.480
and nothing that I wouldn't do.

18:15.000 --> 18:16.510
Tell me about it then.

18:22.200 --> 18:22.960
Xie Wanghe.

18:25.270 --> 18:26.480
Do you have a crush on me?

18:50.200 --> 18:51.680
Since when?

18:55.510 --> 18:56.200
Does it matter?

18:56.400 --> 18:57.440
Yes, very.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.160
Let me think.

19:03.030 --> 19:03.640
Yesterday?

19:07.790 --> 19:09.160
I can't remember

19:10.750 --> 19:11.960
when it was exactly.

19:13.310 --> 19:14.440
Which year?

19:14.750 --> 19:15.830
Before we went to Beijing

19:16.200 --> 19:16.720
or after?

19:17.000 --> 19:17.750
After.

19:20.200 --> 19:21.160
In my third year of college,

19:21.790 --> 19:23.680
I was working on a travel marketing project with others.

19:24.680 --> 19:25.680
But they all skipped town.

19:26.160 --> 19:27.350
We lost all our money.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.680
Stop drinking.

19:32.790 --> 19:33.640
Go home.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.400
Fenghua.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.030
Give it to me!

19:35.310 --> 19:35.960
Drink with me.

19:35.960 --> 19:37.070
You, stop drinking!

19:37.110 --> 19:38.000
Just have a drink with me.

19:38.000 --> 19:38.920
Why are you drinking?

19:39.270 --> 19:40.550
Go home now!

19:40.550 --> 19:41.270
Take your glasses.

19:42.070 --> 19:43.240
Stop drinking!

19:43.400 --> 19:43.880
Go home!

19:44.000 --> 19:45.240
It's none of your business!

19:47.070 --> 19:48.000
Entrepreneurship

19:48.000 --> 19:49.400
is never smooth sailing.

19:49.920 --> 19:52.030
If you fail, just learn from the lesson.

19:55.590 --> 19:58.160
Then why is it me who fails every time?

19:59.030 --> 20:00.000
Why?

20:02.640 --> 20:04.830
If I only failed once, you could say it's bad luck.

20:05.640 --> 20:07.200
But I failed twice, and then three times.

20:07.350 --> 20:08.680
I've failed every time.

20:09.480 --> 20:11.270
I'm just a huge joke!

20:14.350 --> 20:16.230
When I was little, who's the one that told me

20:17.240 --> 20:18.480
we should get up

20:18.480 --> 20:19.720
from wherever we fell?

20:21.030 --> 20:22.350
Even if you can't pick yourself up,

20:22.510 --> 20:23.550
I'm here with you.

20:25.400 --> 20:27.200
As long as you still want to win,

20:28.070 --> 20:29.270
and you still have that will,

20:30.030 --> 20:30.880
you won't fail

20:31.030 --> 20:32.470
in the future.

20:47.640 --> 20:48.960
Just because of that?

20:50.750 --> 20:52.160
Your motivational words

20:52.550 --> 20:53.440
didn't do much for me.

20:54.790 --> 20:56.110
Those two slaps were what

20:56.960 --> 20:58.200
knocked some sense into me.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.440
Are you a masochist?

21:01.880 --> 21:02.920
You just knew?

21:06.310 --> 21:08.310
I should be even harsher to you in the future.

21:08.830 --> 21:09.400
This way,

21:09.720 --> 21:10.920
you'll like me more.

21:13.400 --> 21:14.680
So, do you like me?

21:31.960 --> 21:33.000
This atmosphere.

21:34.270 --> 21:36.070
Did you have this all planned...

22:01.240 --> 22:02.000
Thank you.

22:04.640 --> 22:05.350
For what?

22:06.680 --> 22:07.960
For not avoiding.

22:08.750 --> 22:10.110
I'm on a bridge.

22:10.110 --> 22:11.200
Where can I hide?

22:11.200 --> 22:12.160
Jump into the river?

22:18.270 --> 22:18.960
No.

22:19.550 --> 22:20.720
It wasn't fair for me.

22:21.000 --> 22:21.960
What do you want then?

22:48.720 --> 22:49.790
We're even now.

23:20.750 --> 23:21.830
So...

23:22.310 --> 23:24.510
are we boyfriend and girlfriend now?

23:24.640 --> 23:25.720
We've kissed.

23:26.030 --> 23:26.790
How could we not be?

23:30.790 --> 23:32.550
Let's not tell anyone yet.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.400
Let's keep it a secret for now.

23:33.550 --> 23:34.270
Why?

23:35.110 --> 23:36.240
It was too sudden.

23:36.240 --> 23:37.400
I've got a lot on my mind.

23:40.160 --> 23:40.640
Okay.

23:41.680 --> 23:43.240
Go back and think about it.

23:44.400 --> 23:46.440
Just don't regret it when you wake up tomorrow.

23:48.310 --> 23:49.030
It's possible.

23:50.510 --> 23:51.160
Good night.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.030
Good night.

24:36.270 --> 24:37.590
Why are you still up?

24:45.960 --> 24:46.510
Mom.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.200
Has Dad

24:49.510 --> 24:50.750
liked anyone else before?

24:51.110 --> 24:52.160
How dare he?

24:52.880 --> 24:54.240
I mean before.

24:54.240 --> 24:55.440
Before you knew each other.

24:56.270 --> 24:58.000
What does that have to do with me?

24:58.830 --> 25:00.070
As long as he promised

25:00.590 --> 25:03.110
he'd only love me from now on.

25:06.110 --> 25:06.920
So,

25:07.070 --> 25:09.720
you think it's okay even if

25:09.750 --> 25:10.880
he has someone else in his heart?

25:11.480 --> 25:13.240
I don't care who he has in his heart.

25:14.000 --> 25:16.590
As long as he's by my side,

25:17.160 --> 25:18.400
and I have his money in my pocket.

25:18.960 --> 25:20.590
As for the rest, I can't care less.

25:21.400 --> 25:22.880
I’ll just think of him as having an idol.

25:24.790 --> 25:26.070
You're so open-minded.

25:29.070 --> 25:30.160
Actually,

25:31.000 --> 25:32.550
as the old saying goes,

25:33.400 --> 25:35.640
"Soft fire makes sweet malt."

25:37.000 --> 25:38.270
In life,

25:39.440 --> 25:42.070
there are things that you will never understand.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.110
And you'll hesitate

25:44.720 --> 25:46.830
about what choice you should make.

25:48.240 --> 25:50.000
So, you may as well not think about anything

25:50.350 --> 25:51.200
or do anything.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.720
Just let it be?

25:54.310 --> 25:56.640
If you don't do anything, nothing will go wrong.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.510
Don't worry.

26:01.550 --> 26:02.480
Give it time.

26:03.830 --> 26:06.270
Time will take care of everything for you.

26:08.350 --> 26:09.920
Good girl, go to sleep.

26:11.000 --> 26:13.000
You'll have a day on the road tomorrow.

26:14.030 --> 26:14.830
Here.

26:18.680 --> 26:19.480
Mom, stop.

26:19.480 --> 26:20.920
Stop putting more stuff in. There's not enough room.

26:20.960 --> 26:21.270
Take it.

26:21.270 --> 26:22.510
I still have to take two people in the backseats.

26:22.830 --> 26:23.680
I'll put the water here.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.030
And there's fruit too.

26:24.030 --> 26:24.920
Take this back.

26:24.960 --> 26:25.640
No one wants mooncakes.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.480
You must take it.

26:26.510 --> 26:26.830
This is...

26:27.070 --> 26:28.400
I can buy everything in Beijing.

26:28.400 --> 26:29.400
I know you can buy everything there,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.640
but nothing is better than what you get from home.

26:30.640 --> 26:32.070
Don't work so hard, you know?

26:32.070 --> 26:32.880
Be careful, be careful.

26:33.750 --> 26:35.240
I'll just load them up.

26:35.240 --> 26:35.880
Wanghe.

26:36.110 --> 26:36.920
Keep an eye on her.

26:36.960 --> 26:37.310
Okay.

26:37.310 --> 26:38.750
Make sure she eats on time and doesn't stay up late.

26:39.070 --> 26:40.160
I'll keep a close eye on her every day.

26:40.310 --> 26:40.790
Okay.

26:41.200 --> 26:41.920
Every day?

26:42.720 --> 26:43.920
I don't have time every day.

26:45.030 --> 26:46.880
Well, at least call me once a week.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.480
All right, I will.

26:48.590 --> 26:49.160
I heard you.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.830
It’d be best if you could bring

26:52.550 --> 26:53.920
someone home for Mom next time.

26:59.240 --> 27:00.030
Haikuo!

27:01.400 --> 27:02.030
Xingchi!

27:02.070 --> 27:03.350
Hurry up, hurry up.

27:03.680 --> 27:04.200
Coming.

27:05.110 --> 27:05.720
I'll try.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.160
Go.

27:08.310 --> 27:09.310
Give me that bag.

28:13.680 --> 28:14.480
Dad.

28:14.480 --> 28:14.960
What are you doing?

28:15.960 --> 28:16.720
Why are you here?

28:18.000 --> 28:18.830
Who are you decocting the medicine for?

28:18.880 --> 28:19.480
Who is sick?

28:21.830 --> 28:22.790
When are you leaving tomorrow?

28:24.000 --> 28:25.240
In the morning.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.110
Hey. I'm asking you.

28:26.110 --> 28:26.960
Who is sick?

28:28.640 --> 28:29.590
Your grandpa.

28:30.590 --> 28:31.200
Grandpa?

28:31.240 --> 28:32.030
Yes.

28:32.070 --> 28:32.880
What's wrong with him?

28:33.640 --> 28:35.720
He has Alzheimer's disease.

28:38.440 --> 28:39.310
I didn't tell you

28:39.310 --> 28:40.790
because I didn't want you to be worried.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.160
It's not as serious as you think.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.550
It's common for people to get

28:45.550 --> 28:46.400
this disease with age.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.680
Does Grandpa know?

28:51.200 --> 28:52.880
Of course not.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.110
I won't leave tomorrow.

28:55.110 --> 28:57.550
Just leave tomorrow as planned.

28:58.030 --> 28:59.070
Get back to work.

28:59.070 --> 29:00.240
I'm here.

29:01.510 --> 29:02.200
By the way,

29:03.270 --> 29:04.510
don't tell anyone else.

29:17.070 --> 29:17.960
What's wrong?

29:18.480 --> 29:19.790
How much did you drink last night?

29:19.790 --> 29:20.750
Why are you so quiet?

29:21.510 --> 29:21.920
I'm tired.

29:23.160 --> 29:24.310
Put on some music.

29:26.920 --> 29:27.480
Okay.

29:27.830 --> 29:28.960
Next,

29:28.960 --> 29:30.750
your sweetheart from Flower Street

29:30.750 --> 29:31.920
will sing you the song,

29:31.920 --> 29:33.200
"Just Like You".

29:33.200 --> 29:34.400
Ready, go.

29:34.960 --> 29:37.680
♫I'm just like you♫

29:38.000 --> 29:40.510
♫Strong like you♫

29:40.960 --> 29:46.480
♫Trying my best to pursue my dream like you♫

29:46.480 --> 29:47.240
Friends in the back, come on.

29:47.240 --> 29:52.720
♫Even if I get hurt, even if there are ups and downs♫

29:52.750 --> 29:57.880
♫Only after the storm will there be a charming fragrance♫

30:06.310 --> 30:07.200
I think you should

30:07.200 --> 30:08.790
redesign the homepage.

30:08.790 --> 30:10.270
Retake photos of the dishes.

30:10.640 --> 30:11.680
For food delivery,

30:11.680 --> 30:13.110
presentation is just as important as taste.

30:13.110 --> 30:14.920
Fine, I'll do as you say.

30:14.960 --> 30:15.590
Alright, I'll be on my way.

30:15.640 --> 30:16.270
Okay.

30:16.270 --> 30:16.830
Have a seat.

30:16.880 --> 30:17.480
No need, no need.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.160
Be careful.

30:18.160 --> 30:18.640
Go get busy.

30:18.680 --> 30:19.830
Sure, sure.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.960
Come, have some water.

30:38.160 --> 30:38.480
Hurry.

30:40.270 --> 30:41.030
Here, take this.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.200
This is for you.

30:46.880 --> 30:48.000
Be careful next time, okay?

31:20.510 --> 31:21.350
Grandpa.

31:22.350 --> 31:23.110
Let me carry that for you.

31:23.160 --> 31:23.510
Okay.

31:25.720 --> 31:26.750
Let me take a photo for you,

31:27.440 --> 31:28.240
alright?

31:50.200 --> 31:51.790
I used to make more than 8,000 yuan a month.

31:51.830 --> 31:52.720
But this month, I only made a bit over 6,000 yuan.

31:52.750 --> 31:53.880
I made more than 7,000 yuan last month,

31:53.880 --> 31:55.310
but only 3,000 yuan this month.

31:55.350 --> 31:55.830
Hello, Chief.

31:56.680 --> 31:57.200
Hello, Chief.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.550
Let’s have a meeting.

31:58.920 --> 31:59.920
What is Xingchi trying to do?

31:59.920 --> 32:01.640
Why is he only letting us take on 30 orders?

32:01.640 --> 32:02.310
He said it's for our own good

32:02.350 --> 32:03.070
as he didn't want us to be tired.

32:03.110 --> 32:04.200
Isn't that crazy?

32:04.200 --> 32:05.590
Are we here to do nothing?

32:44.960 --> 32:45.510
Put it here.

32:45.510 --> 32:46.160
Careful.

32:50.200 --> 32:51.200
Hold on a second.

32:51.200 --> 32:52.270
I need some water.

32:53.000 --> 32:53.920
Let me help you.

32:55.070 --> 32:55.640
Be careful.

33:05.200 --> 33:05.750
And this.

33:17.720 --> 33:20.160
This year is a year full of challenges.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.440
Facing fierce market competition,

33:22.640 --> 33:25.160
the group's courier business has reached a new high.

33:25.510 --> 33:28.070
Annual business volume has reached approximately 3 billion yuan,

33:33.400 --> 33:35.960
with sorting efficiency improving by 17%.

33:36.110 --> 33:38.510
We have further increased our market share,

33:38.510 --> 33:41.000
and in turn, strengthening our leading position in this industry.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.640
Could it not have been?

33:42.640 --> 33:44.240
Everyone's exhausted.

33:44.790 --> 33:45.920
If you ask me,

33:45.920 --> 33:47.200
they shouldn't have invited

33:47.200 --> 33:49.270
those celebrities for this celebratory gala.

33:49.270 --> 33:51.030
They should invite us couriers.

33:51.070 --> 33:52.720
Right, right.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.400
We should get Fenghua to go.

33:54.480 --> 33:55.640
You should totally go.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.720
Look at how pretty you are.

33:56.720 --> 33:57.720
What can I do?

33:57.720 --> 33:58.720
Fenghua looks great.

33:58.720 --> 34:01.160
Fenghua, you should represent us couriers up there.

34:02.680 --> 34:03.920
Stop kidding.

34:04.960 --> 34:06.000
Let's keep working hard.

34:06.000 --> 34:06.750
That day will come.

34:07.350 --> 34:07.880
This year,

34:08.110 --> 34:09.440
we've fought a good battle.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.150
Next year,

34:10.480 --> 34:12.280
we'll let the whole of Haidian know

34:12.400 --> 34:14.360
which station is the most reliable.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.800
Do you have confidence?

34:15.960 --> 34:17.400
No.

34:17.440 --> 34:18.480
No?

34:18.670 --> 34:19.480
-Yes.
-Yes!

34:19.480 --> 34:20.670
Fenghua.

34:20.670 --> 34:21.710
They're just teasing you.

34:21.710 --> 34:23.440
Then let's eat well and keep working.

34:23.440 --> 34:24.360
Okay!

34:24.360 --> 34:25.110
Let's eat, let's eat.

34:25.880 --> 34:27.400
Fenghua, I'll go get you a bowl of soup.

34:27.400 --> 34:27.960
Thank you, Auntie.

34:31.590 --> 34:32.670
What are you doing?

34:42.480 --> 34:43.230
Want some supper?

35:01.030 --> 35:02.670
Let's spend New Year’s Eve together next week?

35:18.110 --> 35:20.030
Permission granted. You may leave now.

35:21.230 --> 35:24.480
You little brat, you really think you're Concubine Hua now?

35:32.840 --> 35:36.630
Cheers to the last day of this year.

35:40.840 --> 35:41.840
Isn't Xiaohui coming?

35:43.710 --> 35:44.360
She's working overtime.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.230
She has a lot of work to do.

35:46.550 --> 35:47.920
She's so busy, she doesn't even have time to come home.

35:48.670 --> 35:50.550
Did you two fight again?

35:51.150 --> 35:51.880
No.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.590
She’s holding onto my payroll card.

35:53.670 --> 35:54.920
She can spend my money however she wants.

35:55.590 --> 35:56.880
Look at my attitude.

35:58.070 --> 35:59.800
What can she buy with your salary?

36:00.360 --> 36:01.630
It's all about the attitude.

36:02.510 --> 36:03.760
You're single. What do you know?

36:04.190 --> 36:04.960
That's right.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.230
Attitude is the key.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.630
What girls care about the most is undivided love.

36:09.590 --> 36:11.440
Even if I'm the most ordinary girl in the world,

36:11.590 --> 36:13.400
you can only like me.

36:13.960 --> 36:14.440
Yes.

36:15.670 --> 36:16.760
This is how it works in Korean dramas.

36:19.000 --> 36:20.280
You still have time to watch Korean dramas?

36:20.670 --> 36:22.880
We are so busy that we don't even have time to eat.

36:23.360 --> 36:23.840
Hey.

36:24.280 --> 36:26.070
Can't I have some spare time?

36:26.510 --> 36:27.800
203's performance...

36:27.800 --> 36:28.760
I know it's unsatisfactory.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.110
Don't worry.

36:30.320 --> 36:31.230
I've got an idea.

36:31.590 --> 36:32.590
Things will change drastically after the New Year.

36:34.110 --> 36:35.840
I'm worried that you'll be eliminated

36:36.320 --> 36:37.440
before that change happens.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.760
Are you here to pick a fight today?

36:40.670 --> 36:41.280
Bro.

36:42.320 --> 36:43.320
Your performance is not good.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.590
Can't I say something about it?

36:44.670 --> 36:45.670
If your performance was better,

36:45.760 --> 36:47.000
would I even talk about it?

36:47.110 --> 36:48.070
Do you have to...

36:48.070 --> 36:49.550
Enough, shut up.

36:49.670 --> 36:50.590
It's about to be New Year.

36:51.280 --> 36:51.880
Come, have a toast.

36:52.110 --> 36:52.480
Come on.

36:53.230 --> 36:54.280
In 2014,

36:54.480 --> 36:56.280
a lot has happened to all of us.

36:56.670 --> 36:57.320
Let's forget

36:57.400 --> 36:58.030
all the bad things,

36:58.360 --> 36:58.920
and keep up with

36:59.030 --> 37:00.070
all the good things.

37:00.510 --> 37:01.480
I hope all of us can

37:01.510 --> 37:03.190
get a step closer to our dreams.

37:03.760 --> 37:05.710
Come on, cheers, cheers!

37:07.590 --> 37:09.190
Friends.

37:09.590 --> 37:11.920
2014 is coming to an end.

37:12.030 --> 37:15.440
Let's welcome 2015 together!

37:15.440 --> 37:18.150
The countdown starts now.

37:18.710 --> 37:19.550
Ten.

37:19.800 --> 37:20.550
Nine.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.320
Eight.

37:21.510 --> 37:22.280
Seven.

37:22.510 --> 37:23.400
Six.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.400
Five.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.190
Four.

37:25.230 --> 37:26.000
Three.

37:26.070 --> 37:26.920
Two.

37:27.000 --> 37:27.510
One.

37:27.840 --> 37:30.480
Happy New Year!

37:39.840 --> 37:40.710
It's so beautiful!

37:44.230 --> 37:45.030
Cheers.

37:45.440 --> 37:45.800
Cheers.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.960
Happy New Year.

37:47.000 --> 37:47.800
Cheers!

37:47.800 --> 37:48.440
Cheers to our friendship!

37:48.480 --> 37:49.480
Happy New Year!

37:49.480 --> 37:50.230
Come on!

38:07.000 --> 38:08.070
This place is really nice.

38:08.710 --> 38:09.510
What's wrong?

38:09.550 --> 38:10.960
Is she drunk after only one drink?

38:11.510 --> 38:12.190
Maybe she drank it too fast?

38:12.880 --> 38:13.760
Did she have a drink prior?

38:34.800 --> 38:36.800
203's delivery riders all obey Chief Shao's management.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.590
We also think highly of him.

38:39.440 --> 38:39.960
But...

38:40.760 --> 38:42.670
looking at our commission for the past few months,

38:43.630 --> 38:45.320
we have some complaints

38:45.320 --> 38:46.800
about the current plans.

38:47.710 --> 38:48.760
You think the commission is too low, right?

38:49.960 --> 38:50.550
Indeed.

38:51.070 --> 38:52.030
Chief Shao insists that

38:52.070 --> 38:53.440
every delivery rider of 203

38:53.440 --> 38:54.480
take no more than

38:54.480 --> 38:55.480
30 orders a day.

38:56.000 --> 38:56.280
But

38:56.480 --> 38:57.590
in other areas,

38:57.590 --> 38:59.030
the riders take at least over 40 orders a day.

38:59.400 --> 39:01.190
Last month's champion station, 201,

39:01.590 --> 39:02.510
the riders there took 48 orders a day.

39:03.320 --> 39:05.030
We delivery riders also compare within each other.

39:05.360 --> 39:06.070
As time goes by,

39:06.480 --> 39:07.800
it's inevitable that we feel frustrated.

39:13.360 --> 39:14.230
I see.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.400
Keep following Xingchi's orders at work

39:17.030 --> 39:18.480
for the time being.

39:19.590 --> 39:20.360
You can go now.

39:26.800 --> 39:27.510
Mr. Xie.

39:30.880 --> 39:31.440
Go ahead.

39:31.590 --> 39:32.320
Fenghua seems to be

39:32.710 --> 39:34.280
in poor physical condition lately.

39:36.880 --> 39:37.710
What's wrong with her?

39:38.400 --> 39:39.710
She looks very pale recently.

39:40.030 --> 39:42.070
My mom and my wife both saw her vomiting in secret.

39:42.510 --> 39:43.150
At first,

39:43.630 --> 39:46.360
we thought she was pregnant.

39:46.760 --> 39:47.710
Don't talk nonsense.

39:48.800 --> 39:50.030
When I changed her pillow cover,

39:50.070 --> 39:51.510
I found that she lost a lot of hair.

39:51.510 --> 39:53.590
And there was blood on her toothbrush.

39:53.670 --> 39:55.400
These are all symptoms of a weakened immune system.

40:00.280 --> 40:01.480
Got it. Go.

40:10.710 --> 40:11.880
You already had symptoms.

40:12.440 --> 40:14.630
Why did it take you more than half a year to come?

40:16.190 --> 40:17.440
Besides dizziness,

40:17.840 --> 40:19.400
I just have a headache from time to time.

40:19.590 --> 40:20.920
There are no other symptoms.

40:21.230 --> 40:22.230
Have you been vomiting?

40:23.440 --> 40:24.110
Yes.

40:24.360 --> 40:24.920
Occasionally.

40:25.150 --> 40:26.550
Do you feel

40:26.550 --> 40:28.360
your eyesight has declined?

40:29.360 --> 40:30.590
A bit, I think.

40:31.840 --> 40:33.190
But everyone's on their phones nowadays.

40:33.400 --> 40:35.440
It's normal to see things a little blurry, isn't it?

40:36.150 --> 40:37.230
I suggest

40:37.480 --> 40:38.920
you do

40:39.070 --> 40:40.840
a thorough brain examination.

40:42.480 --> 40:43.510
Really?

40:43.760 --> 40:45.280
Is it that serious?

40:46.320 --> 40:47.320
I can't...

40:47.630 --> 40:49.280
give you a definitive diagnosis.

40:49.590 --> 40:50.480
You're still young.

40:50.550 --> 40:52.280
Go get examined,

40:52.280 --> 40:53.360
and we'll talk after the result comes out.

40:53.710 --> 40:54.360
All right?

41:25.670 --> 41:27.550
Chen Xiaoyu, Room 3.

41:29.110 --> 41:30.480
I can go by myself this time.

41:31.280 --> 41:31.760
Okay.

41:32.110 --> 41:33.590
I'll wait for you outside.

41:46.710 --> 41:48.590
Guo Jianshe, Room 6.

41:49.070 --> 41:49.550
Coming.

42:05.480 --> 42:07.320
Xia Fenghua, Examination Room 2.

42:45.670 --> 42:46.440
What's up with you?

42:46.920 --> 42:47.590
I'm sorry.
